{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12122","headline":"雨中望海上怀郁林观中道侣 · 钱起","name":"雨中望海上怀郁林观中道侣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山观海头雨，悬沫动烟树。\n只疑苍茫里，郁岛欲飞去。\n大块怒天吴，惊潮荡云路。\n羣真俨盈想，一苇不可渡。\n惆怅赤城期，愿假轻鸿驭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12122.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12122","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}